Subject: [PATCH 2/2] v1.1 metadata: cite the published paper, expand the
 literature account

Point the formalized source at the published preprint (Zenodo,
doi:10.5281/zenodo.23425872, CC BY 4.0) instead of an unpublished
manuscript, and record the literature search behind the novelty claim.
Add Zolotarev, Tsukerman (two papers), Girstmair and
Chen-Dunn-Hewett-Silas as background sources. Cite v1.0 by its version
DOI. Add the paper as preferred-citation in CITATION.cff and link it from
the README. No Lean files change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011S9inNFBAsFDJbjSaihLD6
